# scripts/secrets_scan_allow.cxd — secrets-scan allowlist (K13, RULED: D59a,
# RS-28, CXF-1). ONLY exact-fingerprint rows, never a path pattern: a row
# here says "this EXACT value, whose sha256 hex is `fingerprint`, is a known
# fixture" and nothing about where it may live — a real secret sharing a
# path with an allowed fixture still fails, because its fingerprint differs.
# Read by scripts/secrets_scan.cx relative to the invoking checkout (never
# the scanned --root), so this file governs a run made FROM this checkout.
#
# Fingerprint basis (scripts/secrets_scan.cx's own comment on fp-basis):
# every shape except private-key-block fingerprints the matched TEXT itself;
# private-key-block fingerprints the WHOLE FILE, because its regex matches
# only a fixed header line shared by every RSA key ever issued.

# scripts/secrets_scan.cx's own --self-test plants one literal of each
# secret shape inside a scratch git tree it creates and destroys at runtime
# (selftest-shapes, selftest-history, selftest-allowlist) — those literals
# live in THIS file's own tracked source (the AKIA/ghp_/xoxb/RSA-header
# strings the fixtures are written from), so a --root . run over this tree
# finds them too. Each is the tool's own known, non-secret self-test value;
# none is reachable outside this repository's copy of the script.
[allow fingerprint=1daed90c0f1e838ade4704e3e26e0e9089f9fc1e933f9637d313e0c2c2289d4f
  why='scripts/secrets_scan.cx itself: the RSA private-key header line named in a comment and built for selftest-shapes\' id_rsa fixture — private-key-block fingerprints the whole file, so both lines share this one fingerprint (this fingerprint moves with every edit to this file; re-derive it from a clean secrets-scan run after any change)']
[allow fingerprint=457643f44d19aed85fd756aa50cc0cd6b57376d4e8f5a72f9f85972a522002a3
  why='scripts/secrets_scan.cx: the literal AKIA-shaped self-test value "<redacted-test-shape>", reused across selftest-shapes/selftest-history/selftest-allowlist']
[allow fingerprint=295cfae3fd0324ea1396144155edf8813b15659a8bdac45ec865ba0e2b78be0a
  why='scripts/secrets_scan.cx: selftest-allowlist\'s second, distinct AKIA-shaped probe value "AKIAZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ", proving an allow row suppresses only the fingerprint it names']
[allow fingerprint=f785c3e4353c3f99d07ebc025cb8c740d596e3256064267af3874a4eab66aeb4
  why='scripts/secrets_scan.cx: selftest-shapes\' literal GitHub-token-shaped self-test value']
